# Suite 6: local symlink to Dropbox GlobalCommands (regenerate via setup_workspace_symlinks.sh)
.cursor-commands
# Optional local Cursor project dir (not created by Suite 6 symlink script v2.1+)
.cursor/

# Local Cursor / Suite 6 (templates from GlobalCommands; do not commit)
.cursorrules
.suite6-config.json

# Agent session bootstrap — materialised into the checkout by the L9 sessionStart
# reconciler, not repository content. `.claude/rules` is a symlink into the
# governance clone (an absolute machine path) and `.claude/skills` is a
# projection of the governance skill library, so committing either would
# hardcode a machine path and duplicate the governance SSOT. This repository
# tracks no .claude files of its own; the tree is regenerated each session.
# Matches the convention in l9-repo-template and Enrichment.Inference.Engine.
# A repo that later wants its own tracked Claude config can un-ignore the
# specific paths it owns.
/.claude/

# Org CI provisions the immutable SDK and governance bundle here before
# `l9-ci semgrep run --root .`. Leave it untracked so the scanner does not
# treat vendor runtime as this repository's findings.
/.l9/runtime/
